# Raw reference/working materials — not imported by src/, not needed for the
# Netlify build (which only reads src/ and public/). Kept locally only:
# ~600MB+ of full-resolution camera originals and source design files would
# otherwise bloat every clone of this repo for no build-time benefit.
# (This is separate from src/assets/photos/, which IS committed — those
# files are the actual <Image> import sources the build depends on.)
/Assets/
/Textures/
/Brief/
/Videos/
